# Accepted, documented exceptions for the Trivy container-scan hard gate.
# Everything not listed here still fails the build on fixable CRITICAL/HIGH.
#
# Both advisories below are in Python *build* tooling that ships in the
# python:3.11-slim base image's pip/setuptools bootstrap, not in the running
# service. They are not installed via requirements-prod.txt (pinning them there
# does not replace the base-image copies), and nothing in the application calls
# wheel or jaraco.context at runtime, so neither advisory is reachable in the
# deployed container. Revisit when the base image ships patched build tooling.
#
# jaraco.context 5.3.0 -> 6.1.0 (path traversal in build tooling)
CVE-2026-23949
# wheel 0.45.1 -> 0.46.2 (privilege escalation in build tooling)
CVE-2026-24049
